{
  "version": "1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "complex-state-machine",
    "description": "An advanced Flow.StateMachine: three PARALLEL chains run concurrently - Power, Safety, and a free-running Ping<->Pong oscillator (two timed transitions that hand off every 3s with no trigger). The Power chain's 'On' state holds a nested SUB-STATE-MACHINE (Idle/Tracking/Scanning); transitions show all three link kinds - trigger, null (fires instantly on entry: Booting->On), and timed (auto-fires after a delay: Scanning->Idle after 4s, Fault->Safe after 5s, Ping<->Pong every 3s). Buttons drive the triggers; the live state and last transition are logged, and the Scanning/Ping/Pong flags are plotted.",
